        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions #7RB 24 Inch Traditional Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTraditional design 24\" door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of 1-1/2\" diameter Reed handle with large ball finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors. Great for large entry doors when a lasting impression is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions 7RB Traditional Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 14\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Reed Style Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: The First Impressions 7RB door handles are handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 7 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Pair of <a href=\"/products/24-inch-traditional-door-handles-pair-first-impressions-7rb\"><b>Model #7RB Back to Back Mounted</b></a> door pulls for both sides of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "24 Inch Traditional Door Handle, First Impressions 7RB",
                "description": "First Impressions 7RB Traditional design 24 inch door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of 1-1/2 inch diameter Reed handle with large ball finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry doors when a lasting impression is desired.",
